              <formatted-text>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='8'>The most frequently operation was performed in Cash: in the 1st place was &apos;Credit in Cash&apos;, followed by &apos;Withdrawal in Cash&apos;.</run>
