                <zone h='42359' id='35' type-v2='text' w='9610' x='425' y='35655'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='8'>The highest number of loans was consistently taken out in December and June each year, while the lowest activity occurred at the beginning of each half-year (January and July). Similarly, withdrawals peaked in June, with the lowest levels observed in January.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
